      <node id="113794389468252085" label="113794389468252085">
        <viz:color r="0" g="128" b="128" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794389468252085', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;As a trained firefighter I\'m astounded/horrified at the number of reporters not wearing masks while reporting on the fires in LA. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A good story isn\'t worth sacrificing your life and health to hydrocarbons and burning plastic. The average home in 2025 is so toxic while burning that it\'s hard to watch; far more toxic than homes historically have ever been throughout history. This is something they drilled into us deeply while training. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The cause and effect can be long term and utterly devastating. A mask is gonna save your life in the coming years, be it pandemic or flames. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wear a mask, shower often. Wash your hands before you eat. A lot of firefighters died before we figured out those basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;PS- if you have a paint respirator with VOC cartridges even better. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/tags/maskUp&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;maskUp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/tags/palisades&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;palisades&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/tags/LA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/tags/fire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;fire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/tags/journalism&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;journalism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/tags/staySafeLA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;staySafeLA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['palisades'], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 19:29:40', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113794835647878178" label="113794835647878178">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794835647878178', 'user_id': '113268117661032981', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;One who waited much too long to mask up was gasping and wheezing her way through interviews on the burning streets this morning 🙄&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 21:23:12', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795308148380156" label="113795308148380156">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795308148380156', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/@me_valentijn&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;me_valentijn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Heartbreaking&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:23:21', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794835647878178', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795045001145201" label="113795045001145201">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795045001145201', 'user_id': '108196401611111067', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Thanks. All stuff I hadn&amp;#39;t known.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 22:16:28', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795095349813163" label="113795095349813163">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795095349813163', 'user_id': '111682769295368538', 'content': '&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; mask like FFP3 already OK or does have to me some better class? Are we talking about small particles of gas like substances?', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 22:29:12', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795328256710518" label="113795328256710518">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795328256710518', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://soc.utzer.de/users/utzer&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;utzer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Better is always better, but an n95 is a good start. I think an FFP3 is the equivalent of an n99 in Canada.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:28:24', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795095349813163', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795403075687743" label="113795403075687743">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795403075687743', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://soc.utzer.de/users/utzer&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;utzer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paint respirators with replaceable cartridges are fantastic&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:47:26', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795328256710518', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113796675036322776" label="113796675036322776">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113796675036322776', 'user_id': '109705565454117862', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://soc.utzer.de/users/utzer&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;utzer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;FFP3 is the bare minimum, but particulates are only part of the concern with building fires. You really want something that\'ll deal with toxic gasses as well - something like an ABEK P3 filter on a full mask would probably be ideal, unless you\'re walking right into a burning building (SCBA is the only way to go for that). However, using what you have or can easily get is definitely better than not using any filters at all. &lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 05:11:00', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795095349813163', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795327935537084" label="113795327935537084">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795327935537084', 'user_id': '1272131', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;Particulate masks like N95 and P100 only provide limited protection against toxins from fire.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The most seriously toxic parts of the smoke are gases and go straight through masks, as does much of the smoke itself. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is why firefighters use breathing apparatus with full face masks and bottled air.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Organic solvent respirator masks are an in-between solution and have a mass of charcoal filtering which absorbs more of the toxic gases and smoke.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:28:24', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795328858347891" label="113795328858347891">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795328858347891', 'user_id': '1272131', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yes, wear a mask when that\'s the best you have, but avoid all exposure to the smoke and fumes from fires.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:28:38', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795327935537084', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795350204284261" label="113795350204284261">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795350204284261', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/@zl2tod&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;zl2tod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 💯&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A paint respirator with VOC cartridges are ideal, but not available to everyone. Any mitigation is better than none.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:34:02', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795328858347891', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113797038750318304" label="113797038750318304">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113797038750318304', 'user_id': '109301624754661647', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/@zl2tod&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;zl2tod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 3M recommendations: &lt;a href=&quot;https://web.archive.org/web/20221203020458/https://multimedia.3m.com/mws/media/1722719O/wildfire-ppe-suggested-respiratory-protection.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;web.archive.org/web/2022120302&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;0458/https://multimedia.3m.com/mws/media/1722719O/wildfire-ppe-suggested-respiratory-protection.pdf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 06:43:28', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795327935537084', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795365815324220" label="113795365815324220">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795365815324220', 'user_id': '110618113961080949', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; my cousin died last friday, same first and middle name as me &quot;Aaron Christopher Johnston&quot;, from non-Hodgkins lymphoma from a US Marine Corps tour during iraq surge in 2006-2008 where there was burn pits, he was subjected to heavy metal and burning pit contaminents which caused fatal cancer. He was 5 years younger than me.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:38:02', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795389394720767" label="113795389394720767">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795389394720767', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.online/@ludiusvox&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ludiusvox&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I\'m so sorry to hear that. It\'s part of why i joined the Canadian coast guard instead of becoming a career fire fighter in the long run. They were very open about the long term dangers of exposure. It\'s why i have unbelievable respect for anyone who does fire fighting work. It\'s a sacrifice on all levels.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 23:44:01', 'in_reply_to_id': '113795365815324220', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113795970757127117" label="113795970757127117">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795970757127117', 'user_id': '109333785962045306', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I’m no fire fighter but I looked like Anderson Cooper was way,way too close today.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 02:11:53', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113796223882669946" label="113796223882669946">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113796223882669946', 'user_id': '109293576544386045', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is nuts that these many of these reporters aren\'t wearing masks. What are they thinking???&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 03:16:14', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798951316055331" label="113798951316055331">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798951316055331', 'user_id': '111926278893303209', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zirk.us/@CindyWeinstein&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;CindyWeinstein&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;I guess the same reason a lot of main characters on TV &amp;amp; film run around with their heads unprotected while their minions or side kicks are properly covered - seeing the face makes a human connection. That principal combined with ignorance of the risks, I suppose.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 14:49:53', 'in_reply_to_id': '113796223882669946', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113799228913976894" label="113799228913976894">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113799228913976894', 'user_id': '109293576544386045', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mendeddrum.org/@econads&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;econads&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Could be but of course not covering their faces creates more ignorance. It\'s an opportunity for the media person to educate those watching.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 16:00:27', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798951316055331', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113799249238581327" label="113799249238581327">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113799249238581327', 'user_id': '111926278893303209', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zirk.us/@CindyWeinstein&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;CindyWeinstein&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; yeah for sure&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 16:05:38', 'in_reply_to_id': '113799228913976894', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113796497288853807" label="113796497288853807">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113796497288853807', 'user_id': '481886', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; A lot of these reporters are talking about their own houses in the Palisades and Pasadena. They\'re also dumb enough to call firefighting &quot;a firefight.&quot; If I had perfect teeth and an 88 IQ I\'d huff burning plastic once every five years in exchange for an 8 million dollar house.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 04:25:39', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113796531114034422" label="113796531114034422">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113796531114034422', 'user_id': '113687571099933536', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lsngl.us/@alrs&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;alrs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Man, they must pay better than in Canada then. I know two news reporters and they both rent.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 04:34:19', 'in_reply_to_id': '113796497288853807', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113796541160745187" label="113796541160745187">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113796541160745187', 'user_id': '110731444955937079', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lsngl.us/@alrs&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;alrs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;LA local news is a big time gig.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 04:36:55', 'in_reply_to_id': '113796531114034422', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113797342818419720" label="113797342818419720">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113797342818419720', 'user_id': '112683494741964889', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; about twenty years ago i wound up stuck in traffic near a single house fire. That was really terrible and we were a few blocks away. I can\'t imagine how bad it would be up close.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also, those paint resporators are great! They\'re much more comfortable than a disposable mask. I did learn the hard way that they need to be wiped out after use or they get kind of yucky inside.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 08:00:49', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798094345512854" label="113798094345512854">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798094345512854', 'user_id': '111355733048782005', 'content': '&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; href=&quot;https://starlite.rodeo/@RobotDiver&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;RobotDiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; href=&quot;https://adhd.irenes.space/@ireneista&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ireneista&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Past a certain point isn\'t the gaseous portion of the byproducts enough to doom one to chronic issues despite a particle-filter respirator?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;My feeling is that anything short of chemical filters is reporters being reckless.', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:11:44', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794389468252085', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798114698301550" label="113798114698301550">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798114698301550', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; this is the second time you\'ve responded to something we reshared to, effectively, tell people to despair about masks on the false theory that masks are useless, which is not an empowering thing to do even though it\'s framed as concern&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;we do not appreciate it&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:16:50', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798094345512854', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798120265668856" label="113798120265668856">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798120265668856', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; if this is going to be a pattern, we may eventually need to block you so that you can no longer use our reshares as a means of discovering threads to use in spreading what amount to anti-mask talking points. we don\'t know whether that is your intent, but it is what you are doing. we don\'t want to block you, but if you test us, we will.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:18:12', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798114698301550', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798125157588443" label="113798125157588443">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798125157588443', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; we view you as a friend, but we recognize that we and you have very different communication styles. we are being blunt in order to make sure we don\'t miscommunicate.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:18:54', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798120265668856', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798130096567100" label="113798130096567100">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798130096567100', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; if you want to talk about your complaints around masks in your own space, feel free. we object to being an intermediary who helps you to reach a larger audience with this stuff.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:19:53', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798125157588443', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798134997930056" label="113798134997930056">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798134997930056', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; thanks for understanding.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:20:35', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798130096567100', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798149418577748" label="113798149418577748">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798149418577748', 'user_id': '111355733048782005', 'content': '&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; href=&quot;https://adhd.irenes.space/@ireneista&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ireneista&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I had not intended this aspect, apologies for that.', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:25:45', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798130096567100', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798155995421328" label="113798155995421328">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798155995421328', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; thank you&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:26:01', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798149418577748', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798140294495962" label="113798140294495962">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798140294495962', 'user_id': '111355733048782005', 'content': '&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; href=&quot;https://adhd.irenes.space/@ireneista&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ireneista&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I\'m not arguing that particle filter masks (respirators) are ineffective against biohazards. They are most certainly effective.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The fact is that this is also a chemical hazard and people should make sure to use the appropriate filters for it too.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Most reusable/elastomeric respirators that aren\'t of the absolute cheapest kind allow for various kinds of filter cartridges including ones for chemical safety. Reporters should be leading by example, since people will see them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filtering out the ash and particles still necessarily helps, but why not do even better when it\'s possible?', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:23:23', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798120265668856', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798145792362763" label="113798145792362763">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798145792362763', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; we agree that people who have the time and resources to take more robust precautions, should strongly consider doing so. however, the effect of raising the topic in the way you did is to discourage people, not encourage them, by characterizing any realistic effort as useless.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:24:44', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798140294495962', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798151140298593" label="113798151140298593">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798151140298593', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; we realize that we normally are very willing to help you understand the implications of the thing you say, which very frequently seem as if they\'re coming from some sort of alternate reality. we\'re not up for doing that right now, we\'re just setting a boundary. if you contemplate this topic on your own and come back to us with any questions you still have, we\'re willing to discuss it some other time.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:25:46', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798145792362763', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798160393622538" label="113798160393622538">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798160393622538', 'user_id': '111355733048782005', 'content': '&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; href=&quot;https://adhd.irenes.space/@ireneista&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ireneista&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Alright, noted.', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:28:37', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798151140298593', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113798164353632351" label="113798164353632351">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113798164353632351', 'user_id': '112358176636091958', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://udongein.xyz/users/lispi314&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;lispi314&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; thanks 💜&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 11:29:27', 'in_reply_to_id': '113798160393622538', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
