      <node id="113799298333503681" label="113799298333503681">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113799298333503681', 'user_id': '109255876465078415', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mastodon.social/@The_Tim&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;The_Tim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I’m not looking forward to fire season in the inland PNW under the president who’s advisors had to remind him how many Californians actually voted for him to get him to send aid last time. Especially since those particular advisors probably won’t be there this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I hope you’re BIL gets through it ok. Even when it doesn’t destroy the whole house fires just throw everything on ear. I can’t imagine.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 16:18:07', 'in_reply_to_id': '113799262852613057', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113799323133364550" label="113799323133364550">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113799323133364550', 'user_id': '109241377377987039', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://oldbytes.space/@thatKomputerKat&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;thatKomputerKat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Yeah, there&amp;#39;s a real chance it could get really bad. It&amp;#39;s very concerning.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 16:24:27', 'in_reply_to_id': '113799298333503681', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
