      <node id="113821448840787896" label="113821448840787896">
        <viz:color r="90" g="133" b="123" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113821448840787896', 'user_id': '109306687469299543', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;If you\'ve lost your home in a wildfire and it held cremains that you weren\'t able to take with you- contact Alta Heritage Foundation. They\'re archaeologists who have developed methods of recovering cremains from ashes of homes. Non-profit, at no cost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://altahf.org&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;altahf.org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Examples of cremains recovery work they\'ve done include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Woolsey Fire (LA Times):&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.latimes.com/nation/la-me-woolsey-fire-cremains-recovery-20181206-story.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;latimes.com/nation/la-me-wools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;ey-fire-cremains-recovery-20181206-story.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Camp Fire (Chico Enterprise Record): &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.chicoer.com/2018/12/16/archaeologists-look-for-cremains-in-ruins-of-camp-fire/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;chicoer.com/2018/12/16/archaeo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;logists-look-for-cremains-in-ruins-of-camp-fire/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tubbs Fire (NPR): &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.npr.org/2018/02/03/582462990/forensic-search-dogs-sniff-out-human-ashes-in-wildfire-wreckage&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;npr.org/2018/02/03/582462990/f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;orensic-search-dogs-sniff-out-human-ashes-in-wildfire-wreckage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/PalisadesFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PalisadesFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/EatonFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;EatonFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/AltadenaFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;AltadenaFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/SouthernCalifornia&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SouthernCalifornia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/WildFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WildFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://climatejustice.social/tags/Archaeology&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Archaeology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['palisadesfire', 'EatonFire', 'Altadenafire'], 'created_at': '2025-01-13 14:11:11', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
