      <node id="113835114166013923" label="113835114166013923">
        <viz:color r="15" g="124" b="169" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113835114166013923', 'user_id': '109321601315889133', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;Ack...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Greg Porter: Yet another &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/SantaAna&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;SantaAna&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; wind event is coming for Southern California next week. And this one could be close to the strength of the wind event that helped spread the &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/Palisades&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Palisades&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/Eaton&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Eaton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; fires. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://preview-prod.w.sfchronicle.com/weather-forecast/article/california-la-santa-ana-wind-20036453.php&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;preview-prod.w.sfchronicle.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;/weather-forecast/article/california-la-santa-ana-wind-20036453.php&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/FireWx&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FireWx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/CAwx&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CAwx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/wildfires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;wildfires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['palisades', 'Eaton'], 'created_at': '2025-01-16 00:06:33', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113835122983253017" label="113835122983253017">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113835122983253017', 'user_id': '109321601315889133', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&quot;Regardless of the intensity and extent of the winds, the weather service said there is a 70% chance red flag warnings will be issued for Los Angeles and Ventura counties Monday and Tuesday.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/FireWx&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FireWx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/VenturaCounty&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;VenturaCounty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/LosAngelesCounty&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LosAngelesCounty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/CAwx&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CAwx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/Wildfires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Wildfires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-16 00:08:47', 'in_reply_to_id': '113835114166013923', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113835176555050214" label="113835176555050214">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113835176555050214', 'user_id': '108194856164807197', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/@ai6yr&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ai6yr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; as Dr. Swain alluded to in his talk today - at least there\'s a bunch of resources down there already. &lt;br&gt;🤷\u200d♀️&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-16 00:22:25', 'in_reply_to_id': '113835122983253017', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113835412161629125" label="113835412161629125">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113835412161629125', 'user_id': '109560317417390766', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/@ai6yr&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ai6yr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; nooooooo. 🙃🙃🙃 I guess I\'m just attending classes/appointments/etc in my powerchair this month as much as I can bc I can move a lot faster a lot longer in it than I can with my walker!&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-16 01:22:21', 'in_reply_to_id': '113835122983253017', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113835267136640635" label="113835267136640635">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113835267136640635', 'user_id': '109362112631791878', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/@ai6yr&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ai6yr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; nooooo!  Just the other day we had - Red flag warning, wind advisory, frost advisory and air quality alert.  All in one day, in January. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the new normal with a heavy side dish of climate change.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-16 00:45:28', 'in_reply_to_id': '113835114166013923', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
