          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '110316383962616656', 'user_id': '109315182603967008', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;Some of you may remember a couple of weeks ago news stories regarding the &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Tories&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Tories&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; posting leaflets in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Eaton&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Eaton&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ward of &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/Norwich&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Norwich&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; saying that &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/VoterID&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;VoterID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; was not required to vote in local elections…well the result has just come in for Eaton and it’s been comfortably held by the &lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/tags/LibDems&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LibDems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; who increased their majority. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Honesty rewarded.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['Eaton'], 'created_at': '2023-05-05 13:47:11', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="110316451794547820" label="110316451794547820">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '110316451794547820', 'user_id': '283250', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mstdn.social/@JugglingWithEggs&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;JugglingWithEggs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; perhaps all the Tories turned up without voter ID and got turned away... oops ;-)&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2023-05-05 14:04:26', 'in_reply_to_id': '110316383962616656', 'reblog': None}" />
