      <node id="113794992506153345" label="113794992506153345">
        <viz:color r="150" g="50" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794992506153345', 'user_id': '803171', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://romancelandia.club/tags/LAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: since MSM isn\'t making the connection clear, here\'s NOAA\'s explainer on how &lt;a href=&quot;https://romancelandia.club/tags/ClimateChange&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ClimateChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is fueling wildfires (though they focus on California, it applies as underlying cause for the increased frequency and force/extent of wildfires around the globe)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.noaa.gov/noaa-wildfire/wildfire-climate-connection&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;noaa.gov/noaa-wildfire/wildfir&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;e-climate-connection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['LAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 22:02:55', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
