      <node id="113794534737762886" label="113794534737762886">
        <viz:color r="150" g="50" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794534737762886', 'user_id': '109310464675917400', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;Newsom CXL trip to DC -supports LA efforts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trump lied: no water/firefighting planes -there\'re videos. Newsom: &quot;Emergency proclamation is being drafted as we speak&quot;-thanked Biden for drafting an emergency proclamation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trump/Musk blamed Newsom for the fires on regs. -accused him of choosing: endangered fish over needed water resources to fight &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/LAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; -ref. to GN as &quot;Newscum,&quot; &amp;amp; claimed he &quot;refused&quot; to sign a declaration allowing water from N CA. &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/ClimateChange&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ClimateChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/USPol&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;USPol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.politico.com/news/2025/01/08/gavin-newsom-cancels-dc-trip-wildfire-00197076&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;politico.com/news/2025/01/08/g&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;avin-newsom-cancels-dc-trip-wildfire-00197076&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['LAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 20:06:36', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
