      <node id="113794244241810792" label="113794244241810792">
        <viz:color r="150" g="50" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794244241810792', 'user_id': '109304464942897108', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;In a dangerous, false, irresponsible garbage post, Trump claims long-time California water fights are responsible for hydrants going dry in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/LAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;LAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. This is total bullsh#t.&lt;br&gt;The immediate supply problems are entirely due to massive firefighting demands, broken pipes, people leaving sprinklers on to save property.&lt;br&gt;And of course, Trump says nothing about the role of &lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/tags/climatechange&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;climatechange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in making these fires worse.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.newsweek.com/pacific-palisades-fire-donald-trump-gavin-newsom-california-2011882&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;newsweek.com/pacific-palisades&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;-fire-donald-trump-gavin-newsom-california-2011882&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['LAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 18:52:44', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113794319762729393" label="113794319762729393">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794319762729393', 'user_id': '109381535369762740', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/@petergleick&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;petergleick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  Thing is, the lunatic is making a dozen or two deranged or outrageous claims *per day*.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I get that this falsehood hit your area of expertise specifically and you feel duty-bound to dent the tsunami of lies hitting hitting eyeballs at the moment, but...  wait until he\'s back in power and not only spouting insanities!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The maga trumptard herd might feel entertained for the time being but there will be more teeth missing in their grins if their messiah (and esp. his handlers) starts dismantling the government/state...&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 19:12:01', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794244241810792', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113794383468949855" label="113794383468949855">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794383468949855', 'user_id': '109902829147210684', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fediscience.org/@petergleick&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;petergleick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; There is no such document as the &amp;quot;water restoration declaration&amp;quot; – that is pure fiction. The Governor of California is focused on protecting people, not playing politics, and making sure firefighters have all the resources they need.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trump is a divisive, horrible person, as usual. Spreading misinformation.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 19:28:13', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794244241810792', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
