          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113794072416846340', 'user_id': '109304708441896427', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://techhub.social/@Raccoon&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;Raccoon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;If I were any sort of an artist, I\'d put together a meme with the &quot;see no evil, hear no evil, speak no evil&quot; monkeys against a background of flames...&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-08 18:09:04', 'in_reply_to_id': '113794019029591374', 'reblog': None}" />
