      <node id="113800277191901134" label="113800277191901134">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113800277191901134', 'user_id': '109288055954478061', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; fuck Bass, fuck Newsom, fuck every ghoul with a hand in this policy&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 20:27:01', 'in_reply_to_id': '113800261629356965', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113801753842820965" label="113801753842820965">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801753842820965', 'user_id': '107584752843150413', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; why does the concept of a fire department IOU make me think of the participatory budget monies that never actually materialized? (I stopped paying attention to that at some point because depressing)&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 02:42:35', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801726362634785', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113801754190990854" label="113801754190990854">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801754190990854', 'user_id': '109322428921129431', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 😭&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 02:42:38', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801726362634785', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113801764872275791" label="113801764872275791">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801764872275791', 'user_id': '110350881260348912', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I saw a fact check that spent most of the time arguing &quot;actually they have a massive budget so it wasn\'t really that big of a deal that it was cut, more like rounding!!&quot; and then never addressed the dual issue of the cops getting a MASSIVE increase&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 02:45:24', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801726362634785', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113801765944662715" label="113801765944662715">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801765944662715', 'user_id': '109524768408930919', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I think I saw something today that the $17 million is like 2% of the budget.  So a lot of money to us peasants, but the LAFD budget is still something over $800 million.  &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.9news.com/article/news/verify/money-verify/yes-los-angeles-cut-176-million-from-the-lafd-fire-departments-budget/536-4b902910-08f5-42d5-bc5e-bdfad1cb0560&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;9news.com/article/news/verify/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;money-verify/yes-los-angeles-cut-176-million-from-the-lafd-fire-departments-budget/536-4b902910-08f5-42d5-bc5e-bdfad1cb0560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 02:45:41', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801726362634785', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113803008887291314" label="113803008887291314">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113803008887291314', 'user_id': '109689581705717976', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; the budget is a reservation of a gross amount to be spent across a time span. What matters is the rate of cash flow and whether any services, projects, or purchases were held back or delayed.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 08:01:45', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801726362634785', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113805626768413918" label="113805626768413918">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113805626768413918', 'user_id': '554344', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Salt Typhoon?&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 19:07:32', 'in_reply_to_id': '113805622629538126', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113806690050700166" label="113806690050700166">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113806690050700166', 'user_id': '113416359445204463', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; But think of the youtube engagement they\'ll be missing out on if they don\'t get that footage (I swear that sounded more and more like Max Headroom as I wrote it)&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 23:37:53', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806660505484813', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113806715219863851" label="113806715219863851">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113806715219863851', 'user_id': '109258452607789316', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; This drone must have been rather substantial to infict that kind of damage. That of course does NOT mean it will be easily seen visually or on radar. My guess is a hard plastic multirotor of substantial size and weight, or something with a big motor on it, big batteries, and/or a heavy and dense camera.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Probably someone trying to get photos or videos of the fire so they can make money on their Youtube account. Let them video their own house burning down because of the firefighting aircraft they themselves grounded.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The FAA publishes the list of Temporary Flight Restrictions (TFR\'s) at &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tfr.faa.gov/tfr2/list.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;tfr.faa.gov/tfr2/list.html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;which does include the current flight restrictions to support the firefighting operations. Do note that this list can get behind, but I see a number of firefighting-related TFR\'s listed there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since fires can spread faster than the FAA can keep up, drone operators should also look directly for signs of nearby wildfire before launching.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I generally don\'t think much of the US government or any of its laws, but a lot of aviation regulations are quite literally written in blood.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 23:44:20', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806660505484813', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113806874394529388" label="113806874394529388">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113806874394529388', 'user_id': '109344108540506555', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/@LukefromDC&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;LukefromDC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; it\'s hard to see a Cessna on radar, so even a substantial drone is unlikely to show up on one made for civilian operations. That\'s why Ukraine for example needs special equipment to defend against the quite substantial military drones as well.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 00:24:49', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806715219863851', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113806881164792325" label="113806881164792325">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113806881164792325', 'user_id': '109344108540506555', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/@LukefromDC&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;LukefromDC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; although maybe that is just an argument that larger drones should be equipped with transponders.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 00:26:31', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806874394529388', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113806916184480969" label="113806916184480969">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113806916184480969', 'user_id': '109444651036446045', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/@sophieschmieg&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;sophieschmieg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/@LukefromDC&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;LukefromDC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Even worse I would not be surprised if this drone was drone id capable and was beaconing as expected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I don\'t think many planes have receivers for drone id yet.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 00:35:25', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806881164792325', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113807042781017602" label="113807042781017602">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113807042781017602', 'user_id': '109258452607789316', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/@sophieschmieg&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;sophieschmieg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Beaconing or not, that drone was operating in a zone where all non-firefighting flights were restricted.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 01:07:37', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806916184480969', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113807036181643956" label="113807036181643956">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113807036181643956', 'user_id': '109258452607789316', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/@sophieschmieg&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;sophieschmieg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; What is called &quot;Remote ID&quot; via a tiny radio transmitter required for any drone over 250 grams unless flying at an FAA-recognized club airfield. The FAA agreed to designate those after a threat that all 830+ club airfields would file for airport status. &lt;br&gt;Under 250 grams does NOT require Remote ID as it does not require registration. An under 250 gram aircraft (especially foam or balsa) would NOT have punched a hole in an aluiminum full scale aircraft part like in this incident either! That in fact played a role in picking the 250g no-registration limit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note that if flown for commercial purposes registration and Remote ID are always required. The FAA has ruled that posting videos to a Youtube channel is COMMERCIAL use due to Youtube monetizing videos! This goes double if the poster also sells ads on their channel.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 01:05:57', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806881164792325', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113807039585035392" label="113807039585035392">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113807039585035392', 'user_id': '109258452607789316', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://infosec.exchange/@sophieschmieg&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;sophieschmieg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Oh yeah: things like styrofoam, wood, and carbon fiber can make a stealthy aircraft intentionally or not.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 01:06:50', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806874394529388', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113808150514379907" label="113808150514379907">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113808150514379907', 'user_id': '109594406581044506', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://kolektiva.social/@LukefromDC&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;LukefromDC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  a bird strike can crash a plane. The drone does not need to be very big.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 05:49:21', 'in_reply_to_id': '113806715219863851', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113808421318831960" label="113808421318831960">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113808421318831960', 'user_id': '109258452607789316', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://aus.social/@FerdiMagellan&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;FerdiMagellan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; This particular damage shown in the photo cannot be done by a small bird to a slow flying water bomber. That piece of aluminum looks like it took a hit from something more substantial than than the minimum to deatroy an engine or a prop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Birds in engines can and do cause plane crashea though, so much as a paper towel going through a gas turbine is probably going to trash it. I KNOW a rag can destroy a turbocharger!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There was that famous airline crew who had to ditch a loaded passenger jet in the Hudson River aftet birds through both engines killed all power just after takeoff. Somehow they got it down and pulled off a difficult water landing (wing mounted jet engines tend to catch on the water) wirh zero casualties other than the birds that went through the engines.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 06:58:13', 'in_reply_to_id': '113808150514379907', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113808446352226349" label="113808446352226349">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113808446352226349', 'user_id': '109258452607789316', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://aus.social/@FerdiMagellan&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;FerdiMagellan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://aus.social/@FerdiMagellan&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;FerdiMagellan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; At any rate, firefighting TFR\'s apply to ALL aircraft (regardless of weight) not part of the firefighting effort, I read one of the Califfornia NOTAMs and it covers ground level to 4,000 feet in one of the fire zonea.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 07:04:27', 'in_reply_to_id': '113808150514379907', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113807465044040614" label="113807465044040614">
