      <node id="113801972659823967" label="113801972659823967">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801972659823967', 'user_id': '111602301282070503', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;In that interview the fire chief is given several opportunities to blame the budget cuts but mostly not taking it, not sure what to make of that besides not wanting to piss off other people in government she needs to work with.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 03:38:15', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801522184838141', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113803432361891552" label="113803432361891552">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113803432361891552', 'user_id': '34829', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/@tetron&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;tetron&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; as my friend (an actual fireman) says &amp;quot;no water system on the planet is designed to fight against this.&amp;quot; Flames and 100mph winds would be devastating, regardless of +/- $17M.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 09:49:29', 'in_reply_to_id': '113801972659823967', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113803463089739651" label="113803463089739651">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113803463089739651', 'user_id': '34829', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hachyderm.io/@tetron&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;tetron&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; the real problems seem more to do with no funds for fire prevention - clearing out dead scrub, etc., and mismanagement of electricity infrastructure by LA DWP. Instead of squeezing profits out of customers that the CEO and shareholders pocketed, they should have been reinvesting revenue into powerline upgrades etc. Several fires were started by sparks from power faults.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DWP should be publicly owned/operated, not a for-profit corp.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 09:57:17', 'in_reply_to_id': '113803432361891552', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113802735078743983" label="113802735078743983">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113802735078743983', 'user_id': '220398', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://partyon.xyz/@nullagent&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;nullagent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jesus fucking Christ. &quot;Commiefornia&quot; making sure the least among us suffer even more.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 06:52:06', 'in_reply_to_id': '113800261629356965', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
