          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '110811669475057240', 'user_id': '109332814399981582', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://newsie.social/tags/Calfire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Calfire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Air Attack aircraft showing how it is done…leading the Large Air Tanker to the Retardant drop…I respect these aircraft fire crews so much!…CalFire OV-10 AA501 leading in Neptune Aviation\'s Tanker 03 while battling the &lt;a href=&quot;https://newsie.social/tags/bonnyfire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;bonnyfire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://newsie.social/tags/wildfire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;wildfire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://newsie.social/tags/californiawildfire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;californiawildfire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://newsie.social/tags/Avgeek&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Avgeek&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['CaliforniaWildfire'], 'created_at': '2023-08-01 01:04:47', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
