      <node id="113795484699697501" label="113795484699697501">
        <viz:color r="15" g="154" b="109" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113795484699697501', 'user_id': '110142049148273382', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;Tens of thousands of Southern California residents have been forced to flee their homes because of multiple wildfires, all of which are currently at zero containment. The Palisades Fire, which has spread over nearly 16,000 acres, has destroyed 1,000 buildings so far. Various organizations including the America Red Cross and World Central Kitchen are on the ground providing shelter and food. Here, &lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.com/@abc&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;abc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; shares more on how you can help.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://flip.it/g2X0bb&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;flip.it/g2X0bb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.social/tags/CaliforniaFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CaliforniaFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.social/tags/PalisadesFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;PalisadesFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.social/tags/RedCross&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;RedCross&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://flipboard.social/tags/WorldCentralKitchen&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WorldCentralKitchen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['Californiafires', 'palisadesfire'], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 00:08:08', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
