      <node id="113817773184500035" label="113817773184500035">
        <viz:color r="30" g="180" b="90" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113817773184500035', 'user_id': '109310464675917400', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;One of the only ways that CA could be represented in Congress re the &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/CAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, would be for CA GOP Reps to advocate for their constituents. Instead, the delegation pledged fealty to Trump at MAL. This is a complete abdication of their oaths. Their tribalism will likely harm millions of suffering ppl -many lost everything. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The entire CA delegation, except Valadao *voted to impeach DT, but is just as MAGA, was there. They should’ve been in their districts helping.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/USPol&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;USPol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://meidasnews.com/news/california-republicans-flee-to-mar-a-lago-as-la-burns&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;meidasnews.com/news/california&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;-republicans-flee-to-mar-a-lago-as-la-burns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['CAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-12 22:36:28', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113818398873691106" label="113818398873691106">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113818398873691106', 'user_id': '109893062787703479', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/@KimPerales&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;KimPerales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Really? &lt;br /&gt;They have no bounds. &lt;br /&gt;Disappointing. Even for them.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-13 01:15:39', 'in_reply_to_id': '113817773184500035', 'reblog': None}" />
