      <node id="113816100912139461" label="113816100912139461">
        <viz:color r="30" g="180" b="90" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113816100912139461', 'user_id': '109310464675917400', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;The consensus of experts was that the combination of the winds, unseasonably dry conditions &amp;amp; multiple fires breaking out one another in the same geographic region made widespread destruction inevitable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The article highlights many valid points, but the bottom line is that there was nothing that could’ve stopped the devastating tragedy. The destruction, suffering, &amp;amp; death toll continue to rise. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/CAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/ClimateCrisis&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;ClimateCrisis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/Drought&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Drought&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/WaterScarcity&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;WaterScarcity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnn.com/2025/01/10/us/california-la-fires-emergency-prep-invs?cid=ios_app&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;cnn.com/2025/01/10/us/californ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;ia-la-fires-emergency-prep-invs?cid=ios_app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['CAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-12 15:31:07', 'in_reply_to_id': '113816003360223132', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113816003360223132" label="113816003360223132">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113816003360223132', 'user_id': '109310464675917400', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;Californians’ lives are imperiled. MSM are reporting the dangers of the winds, drought, hindering of firefighting mass mobilization efforts, &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/FEMA&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;FEMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Republicans’ constant politicalization &amp;amp; attempts to blame leaders/regs. for the tragedy: premature, largely wrong. The &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/CalFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CalFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; evacuees need to fed, housed…Govt, NGOs, local groups’… responses should be lauded, but there’s so much need in the midst of the ongoing crisis &amp;amp; logistical nightmare.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fire risk remains critical.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://abcnews.link/7qx0gRx&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;abcnews.link/7qx0gRx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-12 15:06:22', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
