      <node id="113810149025961373" label="113810149025961373">
        <viz:color r="30" g="180" b="90" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113810149025961373', 'user_id': '109310464675917400', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;While Trump, Musk, Johnson… discredit Gov Newsom, Mayor Bass, Dems… &amp;amp; lie about the &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/CAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; -still burning, BP has been conducting raids. These Republicans are sabotaging California, now the world’s 4th largest economy. Undocumented &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/immigrants&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;immigrants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; are vital to CA’s economy, esp. AG &amp;amp; construction. Detaining &amp;amp; deporting these valued workers will lead to food scarcity &amp;amp; hamper construction efforts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Journalists report on Central CA raids this week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/USPol&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;USPol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/MassDeportations&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;MassDeportations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://calmatters.org/economy/2025/01/kern-county-immigration-sweep/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;calmatters.org/economy/2025/01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;/kern-county-immigration-sweep/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['CAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 14:17:30', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
