      <node id="113804838813835010" label="113804838813835010">
        <viz:color r="30" g="180" b="90" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113804838813835010', 'user_id': '109310464675917400', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&quot;Replies prove the point: They assert that only white men are capable of doing these jobs — which is what &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/DEI&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;DEI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is code for — but decline to explain why bc they know they can\'t.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I\'ve watched MAGA\'s efforts to politicize the &lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/CAFires&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;CAFires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; with sick fascination bc of how profoundly stupid they are. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Forget &quot;post-truth.&quot; The right: fully entered its &quot;post-coherence&quot; era -don\'t offer arguments, just gestures.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trump, Musk, Rs... are despicable, weaponizing a catastrophe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/tags/USPol&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;USPol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.salon.com/2025/01/10/dei-is-deadly-fox-news-spin-on-california-wildfires-exposes-magas-total-incoherence/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;https://www.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ellipsis&quot;&gt;salon.com/2025/01/10/dei-is-de&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;invisible&quot;&gt;adly-fox-news-spin-on-california-wildfires-exposes-magas-total-incoherence/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['CAFires'], 'created_at': '2025-01-10 15:47:05', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113805017068569291" label="113805017068569291">
