        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113807459590208809', 'user_id': '109362556345297756', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://toad.social/@KimPerales&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;KimPerales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; I read that nationally 82% of firefighters are white men. They basically own the profession.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-11 02:53:39', 'in_reply_to_id': '113804838813835010', 'reblog': None}" />
