      <node id="113800968036200063" label="113800968036200063">
        <viz:color r="226" g="88" b="34" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113800968036200063', 'user_id': '109321601315889133', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/KennethFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;KennethFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Evacuations... fast moving... evacuate early, often folks.. Agoura and Oak Park, high speed evacs&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['kennethfire'], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 23:22:45', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113801057510965174" label="113801057510965174">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801057510965174', 'user_id': '110610621652799925', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/@ai6yr&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ai6yr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Just called everyone we know. Took 20 minutes for the evac to go out. Resources are severly strained. Potential for impact for all of Conejo valley and south into the mountains to the beach.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 23:45:28', 'in_reply_to_id': '113800968036200063', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="113801111194452453" label="113801111194452453">
        <viz:color r="190" g="190" b="190" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113801111194452453', 'user_id': '110433002329275149', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;h-card&quot; translate=&quot;no&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/@ai6yr&quot; class=&quot;u-url mention&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;@&lt;span&gt;ai6yr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  Scary time.  Best of luck.  Hate to see anyone having to go through this.&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': [], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 23:59:03', 'in_reply_to_id': '113800968036200063', 'reblog': None}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
