      <node id="113800925351148083" label="113800925351148083">
        <viz:color r="226" g="88" b="34" a="1.0" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="{'id': '113800925351148083', 'user_id': '109321601315889133', 'content': '&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/KennethFire&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;KennethFire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; -- Oak Park and Agoura need to be on top of this. They are evacuating people, RROS. &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/Agoura&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;Agoura&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://m.ai6yr.org/tags/OakPark&quot; class=&quot;mention hashtag&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#&lt;span&gt;OakPark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 'tags': ['kennethfire'], 'created_at': '2025-01-09 23:11:52', 'in_reply_to_id': None, 'reblog': None}" />
